ich_text","block_id":"x8VSp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aec87f0e-e151-4c82-9f22-3292e97b9460","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ここで `ReturnType\u0026lt;typeof foo\u0026gt;` を安易に書くと事故る","ts":"1621389750.055300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7MC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88ade90b-af8c-47e0-8cde-adff9b6052b4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとは型推論で型は付くんですが、事前に型を書いておくことで推論とずれた型を返すことを防げるので、少し複雑な型のオブジェクトの場合は書いておくと安心かと思います\n型レベルでテスト代わりになるので","ts":"1621389523.054800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LwsuT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7740168-ef1e-4681-bfbf-dbc49576f1ba","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 個人的にはexportする関数は外界へのインターフェイスなので書いた方がいいことが多いかと思います\nたしかに","ts":"1621389310.053500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WgQ=3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b1f4734-d0cc-49cb-a952-6c063019a0a3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```foo \u0026amp;\u0026amp; foo.a \u0026amp;\u0026amp; foo.a.b \u0026amp;\u0026amp; foo.a.b.method \u0026amp;\u0026amp; foo.a.b.method();```\nこれが↓になるの便利すぎるなぁ\n```foo?.a?.b?.method?.();```\n","ts":"1621389303.053300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EdFL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"004f0ef4-29f8-4405-b513-c9b8b4ac3f4f","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"これを見ると、prefer-optional-chain は有効にしておいたほうが良いと感じると思いますよね\n\u003chttps://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/blob/master/packages/eslint-plugin/docs/rules/prefer-optional-chain.md\u003e","ts":"1621389241.052800","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint","id":1,"title":"typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint","title_link":"https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/blob/master/packages/eslint-plugin/docs/rules/prefer-optional-chain.md","text":":sparkles: Monorepo for all the tooling which enables ESLint to support TypeScript - typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/348c1e6be5466c8eabebc8aad0dac146f665aa6e2c78ecdedcf106934e93dd9c/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/blob/master/packages/eslint-plugin/docs/rules/prefer-optional-chain.md","original_url":"https://github.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/blob/master/packages/eslint-plugin/docs/rules/prefer-optional-chain.md"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dE1CX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45203e5f-0507-4077-a866-9e95740fdc13","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"exportしていないなら使われる範囲がファイルで閉じるので、exportしている側のインターフェイスが書かれていれば最悪の事故は回避できるはず","ts":"1621389236.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U38N="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cc0abab-e5e4-40a6-9d3b-238fa877b727","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"個人的にはexportする関数は外界へのインターフェイスなので書いた方がいいことが多いかと思います","ts":"1621389187.051800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LIMo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fba28179-9387-40b7-86fe-2d6d63ac29f4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"単純に、out の型を書けばそれ以外の型の値が入ってくると型エラーになるのでバグを防げるし、逆にoutが色んな型の値を想定しているときは、固定せずに推論させて渡した方が柔軟に書けるみたいな。","ts":"1621389176.051500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k5j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c680980-9f95-43fc-b1b2-05903b762c72","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 個人的には書いたほうが良いケースと書かないほうが良いケースがあって\nなるほどお\n例えば、どんなケースですか？","ts":"1621388957.047800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"okMtH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28ad9ddb-1939-4f36-930e-bf80bc5ecc68","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"個人的には書いたほうが良いケースと書かないほうが良いケースがあって、適切に使い分けるのがベストだと思ってるけど、大人数だと判断が難しいので、ESLintで統一するのが多そう","ts":"1621388912.046900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/F38X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"174cff38-55d8-40cc-85dd-9753af65627f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```type Foo = {\n  a?: {\n    b?: {\n      c?: number\n    }\n  }\n}```\nみたいなときに `foo?.a?.b?.c` が `number | undefined` になって便利とかよくやる気がする","ts":"1621388905.046700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bDcN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6f404fa-7666-41be-895b-2b586a652aaf","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ある程度自明なら関数によっては書かないかもしれないですけど、基本は書いてる気がするなあ","ts":"1621388899.046400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QHB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f086735-8b3f-43bc-81f1-18184717396e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"というか Eslint の設定？w","ts":"1621388847.044500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PD9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cebd9604-1374-4881-a9ca-ba3571f95304","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"人によりまする","ts":"1621388834.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kuYh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c742b91-7672-44c5-9117-9b5458d2b0df","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1621388824.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SgT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78b3b21d-0212-461f-93ce-664869d09bd9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それはプロジェクトによるんじゃないですかね","ts":"1621388818.043100","team":"T