ssage","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`a.a` とミスってません？","ts":"1621388077.020200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"srvyS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8781d319-a918-43f5-803c-594ca860da77","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`a` が==nullでも実行できるってのがミソ","ts":"1621388047.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SBnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffd7c772-4b70-4067-9857-09b85472180c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```const a = {a: {b: 1}}\na.b // undefined\na?.b // undefined```\nで結果は同じなんですが、何が違うんでしょうか…？","ts":"1621388046.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fdx/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4207566e-62cb-4c62-8278-7582c29ca195","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なので `a?.b` の型は `B | undefined` ですね","ts":"1621388017.018200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D/yC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66a6b83f-406e-42c1-be6b-871d2f04a182","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"掘った結果存在しなかったらundefinedが返りますね","ts":"1621388010.017700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dkV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87ce4b55-a634-404f-840a-f48f03a6adf7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"普通にundefinedが返っているように見えます","ts":"1621387987.017000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l6Ymm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3a83594-990d-4374-bf2f-9b93a1be3790","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"途中にnullがあったら `a.b` ではなく `undefined` が返ってくる","ts":"1621387984.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OBdtK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47165d14-7c2f-4a18-8e34-20b7e4d288ca","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"A型のA.bへのアクセスはTypeScriptならそれでも怒られると思う\nJSにとっての型はObjectしかないので、型がチェックされるわけじゃない、でいいのかな?","ts":"1621387980.016600","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1621388000.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SNid"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c11c35d-9d09-4a3d-af86-49c0c81fe051","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"こんな感じです","ts":"1621387968.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IdV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ff37fb4-d1b8-4a50-9c05-bda84060ccda","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```\u0026gt; const a = { b: undefined }\nundefined\n\u0026gt; a\n{ b: undefined }\n\u0026gt; a.b\nundefined\n\u0026gt; a?.b?.c?.d\nundefined```","ts":"1621387964.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3k2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4b5f363-b3e2-4d86-8b17-ccdfceafb49d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"型じゃなくて、存在チェック(とnull値チェック)","ts":"1621387924.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sHHy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c47a274d-8ab2-4f2f-9c2a-a7413096a1e6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あれ","ts":"1621387909.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EsasK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c357c410-6d8c-4b45-b214-8bc95c6c7815","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"型チェックじゃなくて、普通にエラーで落ちる","ts":"1621387905.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CNT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab2e463c-4265-44e7-826e-5c1869edda22","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なぞなぞ演算子だ。Pythonに欲しい","ts":"1621387901.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JsM7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6322372-5649-4d89-b21f-e0d46374778d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"型チェックだけじゃないですね、実行時にもundefinedが返る","ts":"1621387896.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PbZIe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"638ebc34-1783-472e-9d07-aa4dc219de02","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"optional chainingでundefinedが返ってくる可能性があるところに対してnullish coalescing繋げるとか最近ちょくちょく書きます","ts":"1621387879.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bkzp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eb69e74-bae9-4aa4-907c-726787876e5e","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"どちらもないと辛いよね","ts":"1621387878.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JgIdv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9871339a-ab34-45da-9532-e40e0d5ebd66","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; undefinedが混入してても落ちずに掘り続けられるって感じです\n型チェックで怒られない、って理解であっていますか？","ts":"1621387874.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a8os"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b319a2e-dce1-49eb-b5f0-c1156c1a0ca7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"さっきのnull合体演算子のページにも用例とリンクがありましたね","ts":"1621387816.011400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+3dc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8151f6c7-883d-41f4-a75c-ecb2f9ae4829","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`a != null \u0026amp;\u0026amp; a.b != null \u0026amp;\u0026amp; a.b.c` が `a?.b?.c` で書ける","ts":"1621387808.011200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ferZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49ed45b6-f26b-44aa-ab5f-5d3a5c190f61","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Optional_chaining\u003e","ts":"1621387764.010100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Optional chaining (?.) - JavaScript | MDN","id":1,"title":"Optional chaining (?.) - JavaScript | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Optional_chaining","text":"?. 演算子の機能は . チェーン演算子と似ていますが、参照が nullish (null または undefined) の場合にエラーとなるのではなく、式が短絡され undefined が返されるところが異なります。","image_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.2f09512a.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/apple-touch-icon.0ea0fa02.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Optional_chaining","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Optional_chaining"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=El"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6bd6cea-d91a-4081-bc6f-91d6b182efc8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"undefinedが混入してても落ちずに掘り続けられるって感じです","ts":"1621387761.009800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NEN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb5c9c62-20d4-4a66-a85c-320d2e533b48","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます！\n調べてみます","ts":"1621387733.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"88E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbc7d469-c414-439c-8ae3-f3b6feb4613c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"optional chainingですね","ts":"1621387724.009200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qop"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e5dedd3-ff14-469a-bd9f-bccbe00ac6a3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そういえば、 `foo?.bar`←こういうのってなんて言うんですか？","ts":"1621387713.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"000"}]},{"client_msg_id":"710333b5-53ab-4139-9062-69445b9526ee","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、なんか三項演算子をめっちゃ連結したやつが見えたけどそれとは別だった","ts":"1621387708.008700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"939e1b35-ce1d-4b89-9d9a-54de2772b8d2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"便利 `||` だから用途多い","ts":"1621387654.008000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xSkQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a0a3fd8-6e9f-46db-bf9a-084d4c6532ad","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これは用法用量別に守る必要がないと思ってるけどどうなんだろ","ts":"1621387633.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c41a016-620e-46cf-a84c-9b44a2e41ce5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```a = {\n  arr: foo?.bar?.baz ?? []\n}```\nとかやってた","ts":"1621387601.007000","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1621387607.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cTD43"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B5B5F6EC-CCEC-4982-BB4C-38EA06F7EB68","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"割と使う","ts":"1621387596.006800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W9nqa"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nexpr1                           *expr1* *trinary* *falsy-operator* *??* *E109*\n-----\n \n三項演算子:   expr2 ? expr1 : expr1\nFalsy 演算子: expr2 ?? expr1\n \n三項演算子  \n \n'?' より前の式は数値として評価される。その結果が|TRUE|であった場合、'?' と ':'\nに挟まれた式の値がこの式全体の値となり、そうでなかった場合は ':' 以降の式の値\nが全体の値となる。\n例:  \n        :echo lnum == 1 ? \"先頭\" : lnum\n \n始めの式が \"expr2\" であるから、そこに別の?:を含むことはできない。残り二つの式\nについては以下のように再帰的な?:の利用が許される。\n例:  \n        :echo lnum == 1 ? \"top\" : lnum == 1000 ? \"last\" : lnum\n \n読み易くするために、行継続|line-continuation|を利用することが推奨される:  \n        :echo lnum == 1\n        :\\      ? \"top\"\n        :\\      : lnum == 1000\n        :\\              ? \"last\"\n        :\\              : lnum\n \n':' の前には必ずスペースを入れること。そうでないと \"a:1\" のような変数の使用と\n間違えてしまう可能性がある。\n \nFalsy 演算子  \n \nこれは \"null合体演算子\" としても知られている、しかし複雑すぎるため、単に Falsy\n演算子と呼ぶことにした。\n \n'??' の前の式が評価される。|truthy| と評価された場合、これが結果として使われ\nる。\nそうでないなら、'??' の後の式が評価され、結果として使われる。これがもっとも便\n利なのは、ゼロや空な結果になりうる式でデフォルト値を持つ場合:  \n        echo theList ?? 'list is empty'\n        echo GetName() ?? 'unknown'\n \nこれは同等だが、同じではない:  \n        expr2 ?? expr1\n        expr2 ? expr2 : expr1\n2行目は \"expr2\" が2度評価される。\n```","ts":"1621387595.006700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"5040bb2f-b62b-4908-a934-5643ddb2b6e9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Vimにもはいりました\n:h falsy-operator","ts":"1621387594.006600","thread_ts":"1621387594.006600","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b8="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a54cdeb9-5cef-4f82-b05c-d1125f9be9b4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"用法用量を守って系ですな","ts":"1621387558.005700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"myt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47f7f544-e16d-4bf1-a9f6-828951d79932","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"確かに使いみち多そう","ts":"1621387541.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EuSfd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99176fd9-0bd3-4e92-8e14-3bfb3c8cc8df","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"思ってたより結構使いますね","ts":"1621387533.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yE8/e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edd2ab9c-2194-49e2-bac9-