a0513|@gorilla0513\u003e: この書き方、知らんかったなぁ\nname ? name : undefined が name ?? undefined で書けるんだよね？（自信がない） \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E1tqUVsVIAAh0sB.png\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"シン・ゴリラ@肝臓と腰がやばい","author_subname":"@gorilla0513","author_link":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1394825670878842882","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1348486174914957314/-RJqWxMK_normal.jpg","text":"この書き方、知らんかったなぁ\nname ? name : undefined が name ?? undefined で書けるんだよね？（自信がない） \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E1tqUVsVIAAh0sB.png\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E1tqUVsVIAAh0sB.png","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1621387329,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1394825670878842882?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/gorilla0513/status/1394825670878842882?s=20"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fql9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80280210-1d18-45a9-a0b8-e01e9ae82057","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"VimのFalsy-operatorは知りませんが、多分それとは違うんですよね。\nなぞなぞ演算子はnull(かJSの場合はUndefinedも)の場合だけ右辺値になるという演算子です。\n(Pythonの場合 0 はFalsyなので\n``` 0 or 100 =\u0026gt; 100,\n None or 100 =\u0026gt; 100```\n Nodeも、0はFalsy\n``` 0 || 100 =\u0026gt; 100\n null || 100 =\u0026gt; 100\n\n 0 ?? 100 =\u0026gt; 0\n null ?? 100 =\u0026gt; 100```\n)","ts":"1621388531.032100","thread_ts":"1621387594.006600","parent_user_id":"UAZ33BKV2","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3bEJ"}]}]
